From 6ea02e438c3e80e2f4e0e25f48154f96318d20ca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:17:55 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] Universal block form with type picker and working tabs

One block_form.html for every block type. /new opens it with reverse
proxy selected; /new/<type> preselects that type. The picker shows the
selected type's cards; hidden type sections are disabled fieldsets so
their fields aren't submitted or validated. Edit mode locks the type.
Restores Skip TLS verify and Enable logging. Removes the per-type
templates, the accordion macros/partial and block_form.bak.html.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GFYvS9tgNsRjfuEB4vjX1t
